    <briefdescription>
<para>Implements a linear individual growth model. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class models the growth of an individual using a linear function. It inherits from <ref refid="class_individual_growth_model" kindref="compound">IndividualGrowthModel</ref> and provides methods to adjust parameters, calculate length at a given age, and retrieve the initial length at birth. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
